    "section": "21. Flying and Surging",
    "ruleNumber": "21.02",
    "order": 238,
    "anchor": "21.02",
    "summary": "A unit can make this move only when a rule triggers it, and that rule sets the maximum distance. The unit must be:\n\n- **Unengaged**\n- not **Battle-shocked**\n- yet to move this phase\n\nIt follows [Moving](vsdata:core-rule/moving), with the closest enemy unit as its target. Each model must, if it can, end **Engaged** with that target; any that cannot ends as close to it as possible. The unit cannot end Engaged with any other enemy unit, and makes no further move this phase.",
